hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1777","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hanstey huey nahi dekha yahan tak ke main Aap key halq ka kinara dekhun. Beshak Aap muskuratey they. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki aur wo makhlooq ki ibtida mein guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 4829). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur tum rishtedaariyaan kaatogey) aayat."
